OL,3,GNEWSANew restrictions on HMOs to come
OL,4,Ainto force
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for tighter controls on new
OL,7,Fhouses of multiple occupation (HMOs)
OL,8,Fare set to be introduced across a
OL,9,Fborough.
OL,11,FHartlepool Borough Council has voted in
OL,12,Ffavour of an Article 4 Direction, which
OL,13,Fgives it greater control over where new
OL,14,FHMOs can be created.
OL,16,FIt means from 1 December landlords will
OL,17,Fneed planning permission to turn family
OL,18,Fhomes into HMOs. Until now only homes
OL,19,Ffor more than six people required
OL,20,Fpermission.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
