OL,3,GNEWSANew restrictions on HMOs to come
OL,4,Ainto force
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Dave Bruce said while
OL,7,FHMOs provided "valuable accommodation
OL,8,Ffor many people", he recognised
OL,9,Fpotential issues associated with them.
